        "description": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Description",
            "content": "<p>Island Escape features three sun-drenched scents drifting in a fresh summer breeze. Beach Skin’s creamy coconut and vanilla melt into Island Swim’s sparkling citrus and ocean mist, while Paradise Nectar blooms with luminous florals and ripe fruit. Layer them together for a wardrobe of summer scents that settles like sun on bare skin.</p>"
          }
        },
        "set": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "In This Set",
            "content": "<p>Island Swim - Travel Size Body Mist</p><p>Dive into tropical waters with Island Swim, a bright, airy, and effortlessly fresh mist. Bright calamansi blends with sweet plumeria, creamy coconut, and smooth sandalwood for an easy, sun-warmed wear.</p><p>Paradise Nectar - Travel Size Body Mist</p><p>Paradise Nectar is the scent of a seaside garden, bursting with tropical freshness and soft floral blooms. Bright black currant and mandarin mingle with tuberose for a luminous, glowing finish. It feels like warm coastal air brushing over sun-warmed petals, full of life and color.</p><p>Beach Skin - Travel Size Body Mist</p><p>Breathe in the gauzy ocean mist, feel the heat of sand, and watch the dappled light dance across the waves. Beach Skin bottles the kiss of sun and skin as soft tiare blossoms wash over traces of salty air accented by the citrusy spark of bergamot. A transparent veil of coconut milk and sandalwood linger on skin leaving remnants of creamy warmth that’s both airy and sensual.</p>"
          }
        },
        "notes": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Notes",
            "content": "<p>Island Swim - Travel Size Body Mist<br>Top: Bergamot Splash, Calamansi, Coconut<br>Heart: Ocean Mist, Blue Lavender, Plumeria<br>Base: Sandalwood, Marine Amber, Skin Musk</p><p>Paradise Nectar - Travel Size Body Mist<br>Top: Black Currant, Pink Pepper, Mandarin<br>Heart: Tuberose, Jasmine, Lotus Flower<br>Base: Patchouli, Amber Woods, Cashmere Woods</p><p>Beach Skin - Travel Size<br>Top: Bergamot, Salted Tiare Flower, Pink Pepper<br>Heart: Coconut Milk, Lily of the Valley<br>Base: Sandalwood, Vanilla, Musk</p>"
          }
        },
        "ingredients": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ingredients",
            "use_ingredients_metafield": true,
            "content": "<p>Island Swim - Travel Size Body Mist</p><p>*Fragrance Ingredients: Benzyl Salicylate, Benzyl Alcohol, Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane, Linalool, Limonene, Hydroxycitronellal, Hexyl Cinnamal, Geraniol, Citronellol, Alpha-Isomethyl ionone, Coumarin, Cinnamyl Alcohol, Citral, Citric Acid, Tetrahydroxypropyl Ethylenediamine.</p><p>Paradise Nectar - Travel Size Body Mist</p><p>*Fragrance Ingredients: Tetramethyl acetyloctahydronaphthalenes, Benzyl Salicylate, Citrus Aurantium Bergamia (Bergamot) Peel Oil, Vanillin, Limonene, Ethylhexyl Salicylate, Linalyl Acetate, Hexyl Cinnamal, Hydroxycitronellal, Pinene, Geraniol, Linalool, Pogostemon Cablin Oil, Dimethyl Phenethyl Acetate, Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Geranyl Acetate, Rose Ketones, Coumarin, Terpineol, Citronellol, Eugenia Caryophyllus Oil, Eugenol, Terpinolene, Beta-Caryophyllene, Citral, Trimethylcyclopentenyl Methylisopentenol, Alpha-Terpinene, Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane, Benzyl Alcohol, Benzyl Benzoate, Eugenyl Acetate.</p><p>Beach Skin - Travel Size Body Mist</p><p>*Fragrance Ingredients: Benzyl Salicylate, Coumarin, Hydroxycitronellal, Limonene, Linalool, Methyldihydrojasmonate, 1,5,5,9-Tetramethyl-13-oxatricyclo(8.3.0.0(4,9))tridecane, 3-(5,5,6-Trimethylbicyclo[2.2.1]hept-2-yl)cyclohexanol, Cis-3-Hexenyl Salicylate, Dihydro Pentamethylindanone, Dipropylene Glycol, Ethyl Hydroxypyrone, Ethyl Linalool, Ethyl Trimethylcyclopentene Butenol, Ethyl Vanillin, Ethylene Brassylate, Gamma-Nonalactone, Isobutyl Methyl Tetrahydropyranol, Linalyl Acetate, Methylenedioxyphenyl Methyelpropanal, Oxacyclohexadecen-2-one, Sandalore, Tetramethyl Acetyloctahydronaphthalenes, Vanillin.</p>"
          }
        },
